    "updated_at": "2020-09-30T17:01:33Z",
    "body": "Hi @srgvg, I think is is going to be, at least partially, related to #1670. As a work around you can use the [`python_binary`](https://starship.rs/config/#python) option to change the python binary that is called e.g\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n\r\n[python]\r\npython_binary = \"python3\"\r\n```",
