    "body": "Thanks @andytom; yes, looks like a dupe of #1670. Sounds like the default for `python.python_binary` should be changed to `python3`.\r\n\r\nBTW, I wasn't aware of the `python_binary` parameter. Seems it's missing in the documentation at \r\nhttps://starship.rs/config/#python \r\n\r\nThank you!",
